WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit on the edge of a chair, feet grounded.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Hinge forward and let the arms hang or rest on thighs.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Soften the neck.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Breathe slowly.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Roll up one vertebra at a time.
